20:42:22 (info) Rebuilding Auto Path Table ...
20:42:22 (info) Total 514 file(s) found, 511 file(s) activated. (5ms)
20:42:22 [a11y] [polite] Pip: Hi! I'm Pip.
20:42:22 [a11y] [polite] Pip: I blink by myself, and my mouth moves with my voice.
20:42:22 (info) Rebuilding Auto Path Table ...
20:42:22 (info) Total 514 file(s) found, 511 file(s) activated. (3ms)
20:42:22 [a11y] [polite] Its eyes blink every few seconds, and while it speaks, its mouth opens as wide as its voice is loud.
20:42:22 [a11y] [polite] Pip: Hi again! Listen closely. When I speak with a real voice, my mouth makes the shape of every vowel I say. Ah, ee, ooh, eh, oh. Isn't that so much better than mumbling?
20:42:22 [a11y] [polite] For that line, kagex-lipsync worked out from the voice and its text when each vowel is said, and wrote pip000009.lip beside the voice. Every other voice moves the mouth by its loudness alone.
20:42:22 [a11y] [polite] Pip: Oh! A new face!
20:42:23 (info) Rebuilding Auto Path Table ...
20:42:23 (info) Total 514 file(s) found, 511 file(s) activated. (3ms)
20:42:23 [a11y] [polite] An x in front of a face, as in xsurprised, closes the eyes while the face changes.
20:42:23 [a11y] [polite] Pip: Oops, did I startle you?
20:42:23 [a11y] [polite] Pip: How do I look?
20:42:23 (info) Rebuilding Auto Path Table ...
20:42:23 (info) Total 514 file(s) found, 511 file(s) activated. (3ms)
20:42:23 [a11y] [polite] Pip: Ha ha! I like it!
20:42:23 [a11y] [polite] The laughing face has its eyes drawn shut, so they don't blink, while the mouth still moves.
20:42:24 [a11y] [polite] Pip: Hey! I liked that hat!
20:42:24 [a11y] [polite] Outfits change like faces: beret puts the hat on, and plain takes it off.
20:42:24 [a11y] [polite] Each World level has its own set of layers, drawn at that size, so Pip stays sharp up close.
20:42:24 (info) Rebuilding Auto Path Table ...
20:42:24 (info) Total 514 file(s) found, 511 file(s) activated. (3ms)
20:42:24 [a11y] [polite] The eyes and the mouth also take orders: eyecloseto closes the eyes and waits until they're shut.
20:42:24 [a11y] [polite] Then eyeopento opens them again.
20:42:24 [a11y] [polite] eyeflip=3 blinks three times.
20:42:25 [a11y] [polite] And lipflip=4 moves the mouth four times, without a voice.
20:42:25 (info) Rebuilding Auto Path Table ...
20:42:25 (info) Total 514 file(s) found, 511 file(s) activated. (4ms)
20:42:25 [a11y] [polite] Pip: Bye for now!
20:42:25 [a11y] [polite] That wave is an animation: waving, in data/main/charanim.csv, steps through the arm poses on a timer until something else changes.
